      "notes": "Optional GNU Scientific Library facade. API v106 adds an owned bisection root solver that retains a real synchronous callback across iterations. API v105 completes the native x64 CODEPTR route for BASIC callbacks, verified with gsl_integration_qag. API v104 adds owned complex values, output-safe complex operations and owned integration workspaces. API v103 adds owned, shape-checked double matrices and output-buffer-safe matrix multiplication. API v102 adds 177 source-generated, checked scalar special-function bindings based on installed public GSL headers; v101 added the explicit per-thread error/status contract and typed-handle validation. Every installed GSL/CBlas export is cataloged and reachable through uxgsl.GslCallNew or uxgsl.CblasCallNew plus the uxcapi ABI descriptor/callback facilities. The export catalog guarantees symbol reachability; the header catalog records which public declarations are safely generated versus requiring dedicated struct/callback/ownership bindings."
